sn3.11:9.1 starts: Not by appearance
sn3.11:9.2 starts: nor should trust be based
sn3.11:9.3 starts: —for, disguised as well-restrained,
sn3.11:9.4 starts: the unrestrained go through this world.
sn3.17:5.1 starts: “For one who desires
sn3.17:5.2 starts: long life, health,
sn3.17:5.3 starts: beauty,
sn3.17:5.4 starts: heaven, & noble birth,
sn3.21:11.1 starts: who abuses & reviles
sn3.21:11.2 starts: contemplatives,
sn3.21:11.3 starts: & other mendicants,
sn3.21:11.4 starts: a nihilist, a cynic,
sn3.21:17.1 starts: who abuses & reviles
sn3.21:17.2 starts: contemplatives,
sn3.21:17.3 starts: & other mendicants,
sn3.21:17.4 starts: a nihilist, a cynic,
sn3.21:12.1 starts: who hinders those giving food
sn3.21:12.2 starts: to those begging:
sn3.21:12.3 starts: Such a person, when dying, O king,
sn3.21:12.4 starts: goes, O lord of people,
sn3.21:12.5 starts: to a terrible hell:
sn3.21:12.6 starts: From darkness headed to darkness.
sn3.21:18.1 starts: who hinders those giving food
sn3.21:18.2 starts: to those begging:
sn3.21:18.3 starts: Such a person, when dying, O king,
sn3.21:18.4 starts: goes, O lord of people,
sn3.21:18.5 starts: to a terrible hell:
sn3.21:18.6 starts: From light headed to darkness.
sn3.21:15.1 starts: He doesn’t thwart those giving food
sn3.21:15.2 starts: to those begging:
sn3.21:15.3 starts: Such a person, when dying, O king,
sn3.21:15.4 starts: goes, O lord of people,
sn3.21:15.5 starts: to the triple heaven:
sn3.21:15.6 starts: From darkness headed to light.
sn3.21:21.1 starts: He doesn’t thwart those giving food
sn3.21:21.2 starts: to those begging:
sn3.21:21.3 starts: Such a person, when dying, O king,
sn3.21:21.4 starts: goes, O lord of people,
sn3.21:21.5 starts: to the triple heaven:
sn3.21:21.6 starts: From light headed to light.”
sn3.24:4.1 starts: “As a king intent on battle
sn3.24:4.2 starts: would hire a youth
sn3.24:4.3 starts: archery skills,
sn3.24:4.4 starts: and not, on the basis of birth,
sn3.24:5.1 starts: so, too, you should honor
sn3.24:5.2 starts: a person of noble conduct, wise,
sn3.24:5.3 starts: in whom are established
sn3.24:5.4 starts: even though
sn3.24:7.1 starts: Let them, with a clear, calm awareness,
sn3.24:7.2 starts: clothing, & lodgings
sn3.24:7.3 starts: to those who’ve become
sn3.24:7.4 starts: straightforward.
sn3.24:8.1 starts: Just as a hundred-billowed,
sn3.24:8.2 starts: lightning-garlanded,
sn3.24:8.3 starts: raining down on the wealth-bearing [earth],
sn3.24:8.4 starts: fills the highlands & low,
sn3.24:9.1 starts: even so
sn3.24:9.2 starts: a person of conviction & learning,
sn3.24:9.3 starts: having stored up provisions,
sn3.24:9.4 starts: with food & drink.
